▌ Write a Go function that reverses a slice.
⫶ Sure! Here's a generic reverse function:
  
  ```go
  func Reverse[T any](s []T) {
      for i, j := 0, len(s)-1; i < j; i, j = i
  +1, j-1 {
          s[i], s[j] = s[j], s[i]
      }
  }
  ```
